Since April, people have told us their bookings land on the wrong day. This page describes
the export dated 4 October, not today's live queue.

**Merged as one issue, but two causes are present.** The shared parser assumes month-first
dates, while booking-v3 shows a month-first hint to day-first tenants using a locale-based
form parser. See the [signed review and separate tracking issues](/kb/incidents/4471-review).

<Callout>
Engineering closed #4471 on 5 October: the parser was fixed by
`fix(dates): parse dd/mm for eu locales`; the hint was marked “won't fix” because booking-v3
was retired. This later update comes from the course page, not the 4 October export.
See the signed review for the source, outcomes and remaining evidence limits.
</Callout>

